  "solution": "The logic followed here is,\n\n**Logic: A & A = 2(A)²**\n\n**For,**\n\n4 & 4 ⇒ 2 (4)² = **32**\n\n5 & 5 ⇒ 2 (5)² =**50**\n\nSimilarly,\n\n 6 & 6 ⇒ 2 (6)² = **72**\n\nSo, the value of 6&6 is **72**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\"**",
